  "question": {
    "text": "The values of $a, b, c$ for which the function $f(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}\\frac{\\sin (a+1) x+\\sin x}{x}, x < 0 \\\\ c, x=0 \\\\ \\frac{\\left(x+b x^2\\right)^{1 / 2}-\\sqrt{x}}{b x^{1 / 2}}, x>0\\end{array}\\right.$ is continuous at $x=0$, are"
