  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\quad f\\left(0^{+}\\right)=\\underset{x \\rightarrow 0^{+}}{L t} \\frac{(1+b x)^{1 / 2}-1}{b}=0$\n$f(0)=c$\n$f\\left(0^{-}\\right)=a+2$\n$\\Rightarrow c=0$ and $a=-2, b \\in R-\\{0\\}$"
